                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0089c740-36b8-304e-b128-d615834ea883",
                        "entry_id": "11fa65f9-3318-3633-91e3-83332758ac4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A percussive musical instrument consisting of a pair of items to be snapped together; castanet or bones."
